      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Expenditures for out-of-town travel are not to exceed the appropriation in Code 405.\nForm 1-2 must be completed for every trip, and, in a case where the Director of Manage-\nment and Budget must approve a trip, the form is to arrive at his office not later than two\nweeks prior to the start of the trip. Each agency must conform to the Comptroller's regu-\nlations in regards to out-of-town trips. Also, documents and records must be maintained\nfor every expense incurred.",
